        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#1F3864;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2E0;padding-bottom:3px;margin-bottom:5px;'&gt;Legend&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:9.3px;line-height:13px;color:#333333;'&gt;&lt;b&gt;Actor&lt;/b&gt; = role from &lt;i&gt;users.role&lt;/i&gt; · &lt;b&gt;ellipse&lt;/b&gt; = use case · &lt;b&gt;rectangle&lt;/b&gt; = system boundary&lt;br&gt;solid line = actor participates in the use case · dashed open arrow = &lt;b&gt;«include»&lt;/b&gt; (always executed)&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;background:#1F3864;border-radius:2px;margin:0 3px 0 1px;'&gt;&lt;/span&gt;identity, access &amp; management · &lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;background:#155E56;border-radius:2px;margin:0 3px 0 1px;'&gt;&lt;/span&gt;scoring &amp;amp; analytics · &lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;background:#5B3E96;border-radius:2px;margin:0 3px 0 1px;'&gt;&lt;/span&gt;application workflow · &lt;span style='display:inline-block;width:9px;height:9px;background:#C05621;border-radius:2px;margin:0 3px 0 1px;'&gt;&lt;/span&gt;loan-officer action&lt;br&gt;Association lines take the actor colour; shared use cases have one line per participating actor.&lt;br&gt;Log in and log out are drawn once: they apply to every account type.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A94A6;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="970" width="700" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;color:#1F3864;border-bottom:1px solid #C9D2E0;padding-bottom:3px;margin-bottom:5px;'&gt;Notes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style='font-size:9.3px;line-height:13px;color:#333333;'&gt;• Actors are the &lt;i&gt;Role&lt;/i&gt; values. &lt;b&gt;Visitor&lt;/b&gt; is unauthenticated; registration always creates an applicant, and staff accounts are provisioned by the administrator.&lt;br&gt;• Browse, preview, register and log in are public. Every other use case passes &lt;b&gt;AuthGuard&lt;/b&gt; (session, CSRF on writes, role check).&lt;br&gt;• Preview and submit both «include» score creditworthiness; only submit persists Applicant + Prediction + LoanApplication through &lt;i&gt;db.py&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;• A loan officer must assign an application to themselves before recording a decision. Managers see aggregates only; analysts inspect model runs and feature importance.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A94A6;strokeWidth=1.2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="760" y="970" width="600" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
